      "comment": "Tacitus uses it of British pearls (Lewis &amp; Short); <span lang=\"la\">sub-</span> softens <span lang=\"la\">fuscus</span>. Andresian gives it for a pale brown or beige; Traupman 251 has <span lang=\"la\">flāvidus</span> for beige."
